# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Licensing-removed databases — DO NOT re-add to the repo.
# DisGeNET (post-2023 custom license, MedBioinformatics Solutions SL) and
# OncoKB (MSK custom Terms of Use) both prohibit public redistribution,
# mirroring, and proxying of their data under their free/academic tiers.
# See LICENSING_REMOVAL.md for the full rationale and removal log.
# These patterns prevent accidental re-introduction of code, data, dumps,
# cached results, frontends, or env snapshots tied to those databases.
# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
disgenet_service/
oncokb_service/
app/tools/disgenet/
app/tools/oncokb/
database/disgenet/
database/oncokb/
frontend/disgenet_chat_api.html
frontend/oncokb_chat_api.html
frontend/disgenet_chat_api.html.legacy.bak
frontend/oncokb_chat_api.html.legacy.bak
orchestrator_service/app/disgenet_tool.py
orchestrator_service/app/oncokb_tool.py
bio_chat_service/app/disgenet_tool.py
bio_chat_service/app/oncokb_tool.py
docs/nginx_disgenet_snippet.conf
docs/nginx_oncokb_snippet.conf
results/disgenet_results_*.csv
results/oncokb_results_*.csv
.env.bench_*
.env.full_card_bench_*
.env.pre_qwen_*
**/*disgenet*
**/*DisGeNET*
**/*DISGENET*
**/*oncokb*
**/*OncoKB*
**/*ONCOKB*

# COSMIC (Catalogue Of Somatic Mutations In Cancer) — Sanger custom license
# + CC BY-NC-SA 4.0. Free academic registration permits local use only;
# redistribution and public-retrieval hosting are prohibited. Code paths
# removed; local data dir kept on disk for personal academic use but
# excluded from git so it cannot be pushed. See LICENSING_REMOVAL.md.
cosmic_service/
app/tools/cosmic/
database/cosmic/
frontend/cosmic_chat_api.html
frontend/cosmic_chat_api.html.legacy.bak
orchestrator_service/app/cosmic_tool.py
bio_chat_service/app/cosmic_tool.py
docs/nginx_cosmic_snippet.conf
results/cosmic_results_*.csv
**/*cosmic*
**/*Cosmic*
**/*COSMIC*

